{"seq":3,"slug":"design-system-metrics-roi","title":"设计系统度量与 ROI 评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/design-systems-component-governance/adoption-governance-metrics/design-system-metrics-roi","wordCount":3115,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"设计系统度量与-roi-评估\">设计系统度量与 ROI 评估</h1><p>设计系统团队最常见的死法不是被裁撤，而是<strong>无法证明自己的价值</strong>：每季度被要求「说明投入产出」，团队只能报出「本季发布了 12 个组件」「采纳率涨了 4 个点」，而管理层听不到这些数字与营收、成本、风险的关系。于是预算在第一次财务收紧时被砍，组件停在半成品状态，业务线开始私建。破解点不在于多做几个组件，而在于把系统运行过程中已经产生的信号，翻译成一套<strong>能在财务语言里自洽的度量与 ROI 模型</strong>。这项工作与 <a href=\"../foundations/maturity-and-business-case\">成熟度评估与立项论证</a> 里的一次性立项互为闭环：立项回答「该不该投」，度量回答「投了之后值不值、要不要续投」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-度量是三层信号-roi-是三段账\">核心概念：度量是三层信号，ROI 是三段账</h2><p>度量不是「多采几个数」，而是先分层，再决定每层给谁看。把指标混在一起是最常见的失败模式：把「组件数量」这种健康层信号直接当结果层指标汇报，会让团队优化一个与业务无关的数字。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;结果层 Result&lt;br/&gt;交付周期 / 缺陷率 / 合规通过率&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;ROI 账本&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;诊断层 Diagnostic&lt;br/&gt;采纳率 / 绕过率 / 重复组件数&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  C[&quot;健康层 Health&lt;br/&gt;贡献满意度 / 稳定性 / 队列时长&quot;] --&gt; C2[&quot;解释诊断层为何停滞&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt;|归因| A&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;续投 / 加编 / 收缩 决策&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"结果层 Result&lt;br/&gt;交付周期 / 缺陷率 / 合规通过率\"] --&gt; E[\"ROI 账本\"]\n  B[\"诊断层 Diagnostic&lt;br/&gt;采纳率 / 绕过率 / 重复组件数\"] --&gt; E\n  C[\"健康层 Health&lt;br/&gt;贡献满意度 / 稳定性 / 队列时长\"] --&gt; C2[\"解释诊断层为何停滞\"]\n  C2 --&gt; B\n  B --&gt;|归因| A\n  E --&gt; F[\"续投 / 加编 / 收缩 决策\"]</pre><p>三层各自回答一个问题：<strong>结果层</strong>回答「业务是否因此更快、更稳、更合规」，直接对应预算语言；<strong>诊断层</strong>回答「如果不快，卡在哪」，是给系统团队自己用的行动指标；<strong>健康层</strong>回答「团队还能不能长期撑住」，它是诊断层的解释变量——采纳率不涨，往往不是组件不好，而是贡献者体验差、合并周期长。</p>\n<p>ROI 同样要拆成三段账，否则数字会失真：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型构成</th>\n<th>计算难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性建设成本</td>\n<td>沉没在前 6–12 个月</td>\n<td>核心组件、token 架构、文档站、迁移工具</td>\n<td>低（有工时单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续运营成本</td>\n<td>每年重复发生</td>\n<td>团队薪酬、维护、支持、release 管理</td>\n<td>低但常被漏计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可量化收益</td>\n<td>分散在各业务线</td>\n<td>复用节省的工时、返工减少、缺陷下降</td>\n<td>高（需归因模型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险规避价值</td>\n<td>不发生才看不到</td>\n<td>合规罚款、品牌事故、无障碍诉讼</td>\n<td>中（可用期望损失估算）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>只要把持续运营成本漏掉，几乎所有自建设计系统都会显示「回本很快」——这正是假 ROI 的来源。真实的 ROI 公式必须包含运营年度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>收益</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>一次性建设成本</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>一次性建设成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{\\sum_{t=1}^{N} (\\text{收益}_t - \\text{运营成本}_t) - \\text{一次性建设成本}}{\\text{一次性建设成本} + \\sum_{t=1}^{N}\\text{运营成本}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8419em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6709em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性建设成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收益</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性建设成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是考察年数。回本周期（payback）是管理层更关心的数字，因为它不依赖对远期的乐观假设：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Payback</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>一次性建设成本</mtext><mtext>月度净收益</mtext></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（月）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Payback} = \\frac{\\text{一次性建设成本}}{\\text{月度净收益}} \\quad \\text{（月）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Payback</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月度净收益</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性建设成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（月）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>zeroheight《Design Systems Report 2026》（第 5 版，样本 n=147）显示，行业实际追踪的指标分布是采纳率 41%、设计侧组件使用率 41%、代码侧组件使用率 38%、无障碍 36%、开发速度 31%——<strong>追踪采纳率的团队远多于追踪开发速度的团队</strong>，而后者才是结果层里最接近财务语言的指标。这个错配本身就是多数团队 ROI 讲不清的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-节省的工时-算出来\">把「节省的工时」算出来</h2><p>收益里最难归因也最有说服力的一项是开发者工时节省。它的难点不在公式，而在「复用一次到底省多少」。可执行的算法是<strong>基线对比法</strong>：抽样统计「手工实现一个同类 UI 元素」与「复用组件」各自的工时差，再乘以复用次数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节省工时</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>手工</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>复用</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>维护</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节省工时} = \\sum_{i} n_i \\cdot (h^{\\text{手工}}_i - h^{\\text{复用}}_i) \\;-\\; H_{\\text{维护}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省工时</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">手工</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">复用</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">维护</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类组件在该周期的复用次数（可从代码仓库的 import 统计获得）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>手工</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h^{\\text{手工}}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">手工</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：手工实现单次该类元素的中位工时（抽样 10–20 次取中位数，避免均值被极端值拉偏）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>复用</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h^{\\text{复用}}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">复用</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：接入组件并适配的工时（通常显著小于手工，但不为零）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>维护</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{维护}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">维护</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该周期系统团队为这些组件付出的维护与支持工时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这个结果乘以团队的平均综合人时成本，就得到可直接进入财务模型的货币化收益。需要诚实标注两点局限：<strong>其一</strong>，节省的工时不会自动变成裁员或收入，它表现为「同样人力能多交付多少」，所以汇报时应同时给出「等效产能」而非「省了多少钱」；<strong>其二</strong>，抽样基线必须写清口径，否则数字无法被审计。</p>\n<p>Sparkbox 的设计系统 ROI 方法论与 NN/g 的《Design Systems 101》都指向同一个结论：<strong>收益的强弱取决于复用的规模</strong>——为概念验证或短生命周期原型搭建完整系统「几乎不会带来可接受的近期 ROI」，而拥有多年、多产品线可复制设计工作的组织才有回本空间。因此工时节省模型里最关键的一个输入其实是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的增长曲线：如果复用次数逐季上升，回报是累积的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据采集-让指标自动流动\">数据采集：让指标自动流动</h2><p>指标定义得再漂亮，靠手工表格维护三个月就会腐烂。度量体系必须建立在自动化管道上，把「采集成本」压到接近零。行业现状并不乐观：zeroheight 2026 报告显示，度量手段中 56% 用 Figma analytics、50% 用问卷、37% 用代码仓库分析、21% 仍靠手工表格；只有 54% 的团队做到设计工具、代码、文档三处 token 一致，60% 完全没有 token 自动化。</p>\n<p>可落地的采集管道分三类，按「自动优先」排序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>代码侧自动采集（最优先）</strong>：用 lint 规则或构建期扫描统计组件库的 import 来源与频次，得到「代码侧组件使用率」；用 AST 扫描识别「手写样式里的裸色值/魔法间距」，得到<strong>绕过率</strong>的近似值。这两项一旦建立，就领先行业多数团队。</li>\n<li><strong>设计侧自动采集</strong>：Figma 的 analytics 与库发布 API 能统计组件的实例引用次数，用于计算「设计侧使用率」。注意它与代码侧指标不可混用——设计稿用了组件、代码却没复用，是典型的双轨漂移。</li>\n<li><strong>人工采集（兜底）</strong>：贡献者满意度、社区满意度只能用问卷，但应固定频率（如每季度）与固定问题，保证可比。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>避开问卷陷阱：很多团队把「满意度」问成「你对设计系统满意吗」，得到的分数没有行动指向。更有效的问法是「过去一个月你提过 PR 吗？合并用了多久？」——把主观感受替换为可核对的行为与时长，直接落到健康层。</p>\n<p>采纳率本身的现代定义也不再是一个百分比，而是一个<strong>四档分布</strong>：完全采纳 / 广泛采纳 / 中等采纳 / 最低采纳。zeroheight 2026 报告显示广泛及以上仅约 38%，也就是说「中等采纳」是绝大多数团队的常态。把单一采纳率当 KPI 会导致粉饰，正确做法是报告分布 + 趋势，并配合「采纳率不涨的原因分解」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反指标与度量陷阱\">反指标与度量陷阱</h2><p>每一个被当作 KPI 的指标都会招来博弈。设计系统度量里有四个反复出现的陷阱，需要在制度上预防，而不是靠自觉：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>反制手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组件数量 KPI</td>\n<td>团队为凑数发布同义组件</td>\n<td>只把组件数量当健康层信号，不入结果层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳率注水</td>\n<td>用强制迁移拉高数字，贡献者体验恶化</td>\n<td>采纳率必须与覆盖时长、绕过率联合解读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绕过率误判</td>\n<td>把合理的业务特化当作违规</td>\n<td>区分「未受治理的私建」与「已登记的本地扩展」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因通胀</td>\n<td>把所有交付提速都算作系统功劳</td>\n<td>用对照组或前后基线，而非拍脑袋系数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最危险的是<strong>绕过率</strong>。它既能反映系统覆盖不足（业务线需要系统没有的能力，只能绕过），也能反映推广不力，还能反映组件根本不好用。若把绕过率单纯当「违规率」去考核业务线，会立刻催生「形式上接入、实际覆盖」的假象。正确的用法是把它当<strong>需求信号</strong>：绕过集中的地方，就是系统下一批该补的能力清单。</p>\n<p>与此配套，度量体系必须自带一个<strong>元指标</strong>：度量本身的成本。如果维护指标要占用团队 20% 以上的时间，就应该砍掉低价值指标。零号原则是——先建两项自动化指标（代码侧使用率 + 绕过率），跑顺了再加第三项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商语境下的度量-把合规计入收益\">跨境电商语境下的度量：把合规计入收益</h2><p>前面的工时模型是「效率账」，跨境电商场景还多出一本更硬的「风险账」。欧盟《欧洲无障碍法案》（European Accessibility Act, Directive (EU) 2019/882）据欧盟委员会官方页面明确覆盖「电子商务」与「银行服务」，自 2025 年 6 月 28 日起进入适用阶段；技术基准参考 EN 301 549，其 2026 版采用 WCAG 2.2。对面向欧盟市场的电商前端，无障碍不是可选优化，而是<strong>合规底线</strong>。</p>\n<p>为什么这改变了度量设计？因为零散的手工修复成本随页面数量线性增长，而把它内建进组件默认实现后，成本被一次性摊薄到每个复用点。可以把合规收益写成期望损失的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>合规收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>审计/诉讼</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>罚款+下架损失+整改成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>内建</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{合规收益} = P(\\text{审计/诉讼}) \\times L(\\text{罚款+下架损失+整改成本}) \\;-\\; C_{\\text{内建}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合规收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">审计</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">诉讼</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">罚款</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下架损失</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">整改成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内建</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是事件损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>内建</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{内建}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内建</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是把无障碍写进组件默认实现的一次性成本。管理层对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的敏感度远高于「开发提速 20%」，因为前者是资产负债表上的真实暴露，后者是模糊的产能改善。</p>\n<p>跨境业务还带来多站点、多语言的度量复杂度：同一套组件在欧盟站点、北美站点、东南亚站点的采纳率与绕过率可能差异巨大。<strong>度量必须按站点/品牌切分</strong>，否则全球平均采纳率会掩盖某个高风险市场长期绕过系统、无障碍不达标的事实。zeroheight 2026 报告显示仅 59% 的系统包含无障碍指南、44% 的团队缺少无障碍专家——在合规压力下，这两项是最该优先补入度量体系的缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>度量分三层：结果层（交付周期、缺陷率、合规通过率）给管理层，诊断层（采纳率、绕过率、重复组件）给系统团队，健康层（贡献满意度、合并时长）解释诊断层为何停滞。</li>\n<li>ROI 必须三段账：一次性建设成本 + 持续运营成本 + 分散收益；漏计运营成本是假 ROI 的主因。</li>\n<li>核心公式：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>收益</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>一次性成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>一次性成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>运营成本</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI}=(\\sum(\\text{收益}_t-\\text{运营成本}_t)-\\text{一次性成本})/(\\text{一次性成本}+\\sum\\text{运营成本}_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收益</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运营成本</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，回本周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>一次性成本</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>月度净收益</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\text{一次性成本}/\\text{月度净收益}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一次性成本</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月度净收益</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>工时节省用基线对比法：复用次数 × 手工与复用的工时差 − 维护工时；提升的关键输入是复用次数的增长曲线，而它在短生命周期产品上几乎为零。</li>\n<li>采集优先自动化：代码侧使用率与绕过率是最该先建的指标；采纳率应报告四档分布与趋势，而非单一百分比。</li>\n<li>绕过率是需求信号，不是违规率；把它当考核项会催生形式接入。</li>\n<li>跨境电商把合规（EU EAA，2025-06-28 起适用，EN 301 549 2026 版采用 WCAG 2.2）计入收益账，用期望损失而非产能改善说服管理层；度量必须按站点切分，避免全球平均值掩盖高风险市场。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;采集信号&lt;br/&gt;自动化优先&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;三层指标&lt;br/&gt;结果/诊断/健康&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;三段账 ROI&lt;br/&gt;含运营成本&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;财务语言汇报&lt;br/&gt;回本周期&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;续投决策&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; A\">graph LR\n  A[\"采集信号&lt;br/&gt;自动化优先\"] --&gt; B[\"三层指标&lt;br/&gt;结果/诊断/健康\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"三段账 ROI&lt;br/&gt;含运营成本\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"财务语言汇报&lt;br/&gt;回本周期\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"续投决策\"]\n  E --&gt; A</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"设计系统度量与 ROI 评估","id":"设计系统度量与-roi-评估"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：度量是三层信号，ROI 是三段账","id":"核心概念-度量是三层信号-roi-是三段账"},{"level":2,"text":"把「节省的工时」算出来","id":"把-节省的工时-算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"数据采集：让指标自动流动","id":"数据采集-让指标自动流动"},{"level":2,"text":"反指标与度量陷阱","id":"反指标与度量陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商语境下的度量：把合规计入收益","id":"跨境电商语境下的度量-把合规计入收益"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"弃用、迁移与遗留组件治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/design-systems-component-governance/adoption-governance-metrics/deprecation-migration-legacy"},"next":null}